+selections, transfers, request statuses, plan endings, tool use, samples and final save.
+
+## Verification and fresh critical review
+
+The pre-implementation red run failed all three new contracts: storage-only plan
+dropped, `canObtain` false, promise collection missing (`stored-materials-red.log`).
+The implemented boundary suite has 15 passing tests: locality/purity, independent
+switches and old rules, real successful collection/crafting/tool use, actual request
+and promise delivery, absent observer, urgent need and competing commitments,
+stale/depleted stock, ownership change mid-work, interruption/capacity/idempotence,
+partial withdrawal, disappeared target, expiry/cancellation and journey save/load.
