+
+No incompatible gate baseline was overwritten. DEVELOPMENT_POLICY explicitly permits
+a causal feature without an aggregate claim and states that a new generation cannot
+pass an older generation's gate. Full gate/control/nudge measurements remain unrun.
+
+## Reproduction and follow-up
+
+Exact commands are in the rules-40 section of `STAGE_VERIFICATION_RUNBOOK.md`.
+Production changes: `material_stock.ts`, `intent.ts`, `social.ts`, `options_work.ts`,
